<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>third day of the first test between Zimbabwe and England at</p>
<p>Queen's Club on Friday:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe 376 (A.Flower 112, A.Campbell 84)</p>
<p>England (overnight 48-1):</p>
<p> N.Knight lbw b Olonga		    56</p>
<p> M.Atherton lbw b P.Strang		16</p>
<p> A.Stewart lbw b P.Strang		 48</p>
<p> N.Hussain not out			 101</p>
<p> G.Thorpe c Campbell b P.Strang	 13</p>
<p> J.Crawley not out			  51</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-2 w-1 nb-14)	    21</p>
<p> Total (for four wickets)		306</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-48 2-92 3-160 4-180</p>
<p>To bat: R.Croft, D.Gough, C.Silverwood, A.Mullally,</p>
<p>P.Tufnell</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Streak 23-6-52-0 (nb7), B.Strang</p>
<p>17-5-54-0 (nb1), P.Strang 37-10-83-3, Olonga 17-1-72-1 (nb6 w1),</p>
<p>Whittall 7-2-19-0, G.Flower 7-3-20-0</p>
</text>
